  "mermaid": "sequenceDiagram\n  participant boot as boot\n  participant app_task as app_task\n  participant dht_poll as dht_poll\n  participant dht22_gpio as dht22_gpio\n  participant timer_node as timer_node\n  participant dht_stream as dht_stream\n  participant _uart as _uart\n\n  boot->>app_task: app_main init, start app_task\n  app_task->>dht_poll: create/start polling task (APP_DHT22_POLL_INTERVAL_MS)\n  app_task->>dht_stream: create/start streaming task (APP_STREAM_PERIOD_MS)\n\n  loop every APP_DHT22_POLL_INTERVAL_MS\n    dht_poll->>timer_node: esp_timer_get_time() for timing\n    dht_poll->>dht22_gpio: gpio_config(open-drain + pull-up)\n    dht_poll->>dht22_gpio: drive low (start), then release and read pulse widths\n  end\n\n  loop every APP_STREAM_PERIOD_MS\n    dht_stream->>_uart: write CSV line (optional header)\n  end",
  "title": "Initialization and periodic DHT22 read + UART streaming"
